onents. For those more interested in catching big air, Snowboarding's Trick Mode requires gamers to perform numerous maneuvers to gain more time to complete courses. In both modes, gamers can choose from one of three different boarder characters as they ride through the game's 27 different courses. Additionally, each of these courses can be tackled by two players at once in a horizontally divided split-screen.", "themes": [{"id": 32, "name": "Non-fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/snowboarding", "videos": [{"id": 169080, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "rAvG85T7aG4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rAvG85T7aG4", "title": "PlayStation - Simple 1500 Series Vol 027 - The SnowBoard (2000)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rAvG85T7aG4/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2194, "name": "Simple 1500"}]}